    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Large Object</em></p><p><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 15 <strong>Hit Points:</strong> 150</p><p><em><strong>Trebuchet Stone (Requires Load and Aim).</strong></em> <em>Ranged Attack Roll:</em> +5, range 300/1,200 ft. (can’t hit targets within 60 feet of itself). <em>Hit:</em> 44 (8d10) Bludgeoning damage.</p><p>A Trebuchet is a catapult that throws its payload in a high arc so it can hit targets behind walls. Loading a Trebuchet requires two Utilize actions, and aiming it requires two more Utilize actions. Then a crew member can take the Trebuchet Stone action.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-nctcVsxSpq9KINsc\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This item has 2 limited uses for tracking loading. Aiming must be tracked manually.</p><p>The <strong>Load</strong> activity grants one use so after two uses you can use the <strong>Trebuchet Stone</strong> activity.</p></section>",
